206 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 100 0 R
/E (The Hidden Directory and File Enumeration project demonstrated how directory and file enumeration can reveal resources that are not immediately visible from a web application's homepage. Gobuster was used for automated enumeration, while cURL was used to manually verify selected findings. The assessment identified several accessible application endpoints and restricted directories. The most notable finding was the publicly accessible /_vti_cnf/ directory, which disclosed application metadata and resource information. The exercise highlighted the importance of restricting unnecessary files and directories and minimizing information exposed by web applications.)
/Pg 26 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
